#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/measure_dialog.rs:98
msgid "%t will be launched %n times — %h with your current settings and %h with the optimizations applied — for about %m minutes in total.\n\nYour settings are restored afterwards, including if something goes wrong. Leave the game in a scene that keeps rendering; a pause menu measures the pause menu.\n\nHow the result is decided: runs alternate between the two configurations, the first run of each is discarded (a cold shader cache is unlike every run after it), and a difference counts only when it is larger than the variation between repeated runs of the same configuration and significant at 95 %. Anything smaller is reported as no change, never as a small gain."
msgstr ""

